    <markdownProperty name="text" category="detail"><![CDATA[The table below summarises the loan policy the Library applies today. BiblioUS must support it from day one, and the values must be configurable.

| User type | Max. items | Loan period | Renewals |
|---|---|---|---|
| Undergraduate student | 6 | 14 days | 2 |
| Postgraduate student | 10 | 30 days | 3 |
| Teaching and research staff | 25 | 60 days | 5 |
| Administrative staff | 6 | 14 days | 2 |

A loan cannot be renewed while the item has an active hold.]]></markdownProperty>
